# Task Tracker

Personal task management app. Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Postgres (via Prisma), NextAuth.

## Architecture
- Server components by default, client components only for interactivity
- All database queries through Prisma (no raw SQL)
- All server actions in src/actions/
- Tasks always scoped to authenticated user

## File Structure
- src/app/: pages, layouts, API routes
- src/components/ui/: generic reusable (Button, Input, Card, Badge)
- src/components/tasks/: task-specific (TaskList, TaskForm, TaskCard, StatusBadge)
- src/lib/: utilities (formatDate, validateInput, tokenUtils)
- src/types/: TypeScript definitions
- src/actions/: server actions for CRUD and auth

## Design
Follow design-system.md. All styling through Tailwind.

## Rules
- New features need tests before merge
- Run npm audit weekly
- Max effort for architecture, medium for features, low for edits
